  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NJ Human rights support - safety, ethics, equality and quality in journalism</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main goal is to increase the safety of journalists and gender equality in the media businesses and in media representation through regional training of trainers and national workshops, and to increase journalism quality - through conferences and trainings in journalistic methods, fact checking, in use of the right to information laws and support to campaigns and debates on freedom of speech, independent media and press freedom.The project&#x2019;s target group is journalists in developing countries. All courses aim to have equal gender representation, and several of the courses are primarily focused on women journalists.</narrative>
  </description>
